/-- The category of compatible pairs of modules over
`D = D' \otimes_{B'} B` and `C' = D' \otimes_{B'} A'`, identified over
`C = D' \otimes_{B'} A`. -/
public noncomputable abbrev CompatibleModules : Type (max v uD' uB uA' uA + 1) :=
